{%- comment -%}
  PG Orb Title: the Crystal Legends Orb page's product title and rating line —
  same weight and size as the R36S page, and both centred on phones.

  BOLD, LIKE THE R36S. pg-landing styles the title once for every landing page:

      .pgx-title{font-family:'Roboto Slab';font-size:46px;font-weight:600}
      @media (max-width:900px){ .pgx-title{font-size:34px} }

  so the R36S and the wall art both show a 34px semibold title on a phone. The
  orb page did not, because pg-tiktok-pdp shrinks it as part of fitting the
  photo, the stars and the first bundle tile onto one screen:

      html body #pgx .pgx-buy > .pgx-title{font-size:20px !important}
      #pgx .pgx-buy > .pgx-title{order:1;font-size:23px !important}

  That was the whole visible difference — the weight was already the same on
  both pages — so "make it bold like the R36S" is two things: the size back to
  34px, and 700 rather than 600 for the bold that was asked for. 700 is the
  heaviest Roboto Slab weight pg-landing loads (400;500;600;700), so it renders
  as a real cut of the typeface instead of a browser-synthesised fake bold.

  CENTRED, PHONES ONLY. The title and the star / "496 verified reviews" line
  are centred under the photo, per the owner. .pgx-rating is a flex row, so it
  is centred with justify-content rather than text-align. Desktop is left alone:
  there the buy column sits beside the gallery in a two-column grid, where a
  centred heading would not line up with anything below it.

  Its own section rather than an edit inside pg-tiktok-pdp: that file is the ad
  landing's layout logic and this is typography, so it stays separate and is
  registered in templates/product.pg-crystal.json only.
  `html body #pgx .pgx-buy > .pgx-title` matches pg-tiktok-pdp's own selector
  specificity and this section renders after it, so it wins on order.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  html body #pgx .pgx-title{font-weight:700 !important}
  @media (max-width:900px){
    html body #pgx .pgx-buy > .pgx-title{
      font-size:34px !important;
      line-height:1.08 !important;
      margin:2px 0 6px !important;
      text-align:center !important;
    }
    html body #pgx .pgx-buy > .pgx-rating{
      justify-content:center !important;
      text-align:center !important;
    }
  }
</style>
